This folder is where Gemini-generated photos get dropped, per the image
table in CAHIER-DES-CHARGES.md. Expected filenames:

hero-home.jpg
about-campus.jpg
classroom-1.jpg
classroom-2.jpg
teacher-1.jpg
teacher-2.jpg
teacher-3.jpg
student-story-1.jpg
student-story-2.jpg
library-study.jpg
computer-lab.jpg
group-outdoor.jpg
contact-office.jpg
favicon-source.png

The site builds and runs fine with this folder empty — every image slot
falls back to a styled CSS placeholder (see app/components/PhotoFrame.tsx
and app/components/Logo.tsx).
